QuantumLeanLeap
Distributed under Apache-2.0; see LICENSE.

The 36 benchmark problem specifications are adapted from QudeLeap Team's
Lean-QuantumAlg-Bench, commit b540e86938ea82a546cfa55bed766adc894c2400,
https://github.com/QudeLeap/Lean-QuantumAlg-Bench (Apache-2.0).
Original notices are retained in adapted definitions. Statements were translated
into local matrix/QHL types; source hashes and changes are in bench/migration.json
and docs/Bench36-migration.md. No Lean-QuantumAlg algorithm library is included.

Mathlib and Physlib are separately distributed dependencies with their own notices.
This is an independent research implementation, not an official Google release.
